detaileddescription.para:
T



Type of matrix elements (must be float or double). 





dense



The dense matrix operand. 




sparse



The sparse COO matrix operand. 




A new DenseMatrix<T> containing the result of the addition. 



std::invalid_argument



If the input matrices do not have the same shape.



Example: DenseMatrix<float>A(2,2);
A.set(0,0,1.0f);
A.set(1,1,2.0f);

SparseCOOMatrix<float>B(2,2);
B.set(0,1,3.0f);

DenseMatrix<float>C=A+B;
//C(0,0)==1.0
//C(0,1)==3.0
//C(1,1)==2.0

